  "verseCount": 9,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "52",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 52"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "52",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "cl"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Psalm 52",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For the director of music. A",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "tl"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "maskil",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David. When Doeg the Edomite had gone to Saul and told him: \"David has gone to the house of Ahimelek.\"",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do you boast of evil, you mighty hero?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Why do you boast all day long,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you who are a disgrace in the eyes of God?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You who practice deceit,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "your tongue plots destruction;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "it is like a sharpened razor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You love evil rather than good,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "falsehood rather than speaking the truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You love every harmful word,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you deceitful tongue!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely God will bring you down to everlasting ruin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He will snatch you up and pluck you from your tent;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "he will uproot you from the land of the living.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous will see and fear;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they will laugh at you, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Here now is the man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "who did not make God his stronghold",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 52:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but trusted in his great wealth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and grew strong by destroying others!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I am like an olive tree",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "flourishing in the house of God;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 52:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I trust in God's unfailing love",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For what you have done I will always praise you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in the presence of your faithful people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "PSA 52:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "And I will hope in your name,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 52:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for your name is good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
